## 2. `JSON_SCHEMA.md` Structure Baseline
This file serves as the strict Prompt Template template users provide to their preferred LLM, enforcing generation matching Phase 16 schema constants natively.

### The System Prompt (For LLM Generation)
*Instruct the LLM: Generate a structured course using ONLY this exact dual-translation JSON array. Output absolute raw JSON...*

